{
  "date": "2026-11-04",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "蚂蚁数科在香港推出KYA方案，给AI智能体做身份认证",
  "title_en": "Ant Digital Technologies launches KYA in Hong Kong, an identity check for AI agents",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "2026年香港金融科技周从11月2日开始。蚂蚁数科在展会上推出了KYA方案。KYA的意思是“认识你的智能体”，英文是Know Your Agent。",
      "en": "Hong Kong Fintech Week 2026 began on November 2. At the event, Ant Digital Technologies launched a KYA solution. KYA means \"Know Your Agent\" in English."
    },
    {
      "zh": "KYA是为AI智能体设计的身份信任方案，属于蚂蚁数科的安全品牌ZOLOZ。ZOLOZ以前已经有KYC（了解客户）和KYB（了解企业）的能力，KYA是在这个基础上增加的。",
      "en": "KYA is an identity-and-trust solution designed for AI agents, and it belongs to Ant Digital's security brand ZOLOZ. ZOLOZ already had KYC (know your customer) and KYB (know your business) capabilities, and KYA was added on top of this foundation."
    },
    {
      "zh": "香港特首李家超去蚂蚁数科的展位参观了。蚂蚁数科还展示了智能体平台Agentar，它有通用版，也有金融、能源和医疗等行业版。",
      "en": "Hong Kong's Chief Executive John Lee visited Ant Digital's booth. The company also showed its agent platform Agentar, which has a general edition as well as industry editions for finance, energy, healthcare and more."
    },
    {
      "zh": "蚂蚁数科把海外总部设在香港，计划以香港为中心，向东南亚、欧洲和中东发展。公司说，它在全球有300多个合作伙伴和3万多家企业客户。",
      "en": "Ant Digital has put its overseas headquarters in Hong Kong and plans to use Hong Kong as a hub to expand into Southeast Asia, Europe and the Middle East. The company said it has more than 300 partners and over 30,000 enterprise clients worldwide."
    }
  ],
